=== input collection ===
NIN           @ iteration count
CPY A RX

=== edge cases ===
JEQ RX [0] zero
JEQ RX [1] c1
JEQ RX [2] c2

=== prepare memory ===
CPY [0] {0}
CPY [1] {1}
DEC RX
DEC RX

=== set up output ===
NOU {0}
OUT [W]     @ space (32)
NOU {1}

=== main loop ===
) loop
ADD {0} {1} @ the next number from the two in memory
JCD V err   @ jump to err on an overflow

OUT [W]     @ output a space, then the number
NOU A
CPY A {0}

SWP {0} {1} @ keep only what is needed for the next iteration
DEC RX
JGR RX 0 loop
HLT

=== 0 edge case ===
) zero
HLT

=== 1 edge case ===
) c1
NOU [0]
HLT

=== 2 edge case ===
) c2
NOU [0]     @ memory has not been prepared yet at this point
OUT [W]
NOU [1]
HLT

=== overflow error ===
) err
OUT [*]    @ E (69)
OUT [1X]   @ r (114)
OUT [1X]   @ r (114)
